{"id": "49902", "title": "宝宝穿越记", "author": "闲鱼coco", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/49/49902.htm", "intro": "轻吻怀里晕厥过去的女子，男子宠爱的抚摸著她的鬓角，脸颊，直到圆润小巧的鼻尖，心里涌上阵阵的甜蜜，这是属於他的妹妹，只属於他一个人的妹妹呢。手指维压，戏虐的点点那冒著薄汗的鼻头，却感觉不到平日里那软绵的气息，一股不吉的预感忽然闯入心间，男子赶紧将双指放在女子鼻下探了探。平静无波的手感却让他分外的心慌，感觉握住女子的双肩拼命的摇晃著，嘴里不停的呼唤著，“晴儿，晴儿。你快醒醒，别吓哥哥呀！”", "base": "files/article/html/49/49902", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记1", "file": "7123669.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记2", "file": "7123670.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记3", "file": "7123671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记4", "file": "7123672.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记6", "file": "7123673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记7", "file": "7123674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记8", "file": "7123675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记9", "file": "7123676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记10", "file": "7123677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记11", "file": "7123678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记12", "file": "7123679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记13", "file": "7123680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记14", "file": "7123681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记15", "file": "7123682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记16", "file": "7123683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记17", "file": "7123684.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记18", "file": "7123685.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记19", "file": "7123686.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记20", "file": "7123687.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记21", "file": "7123688.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记22", "file": "7123689.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记23", "file": "7123690.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记24", "file": "7123691.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宝宝穿越记25",